#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:5
#: 0d5b55a2e1d44632a420671d7c10bf7e 35a0def6194b4dff916a22b8a5fda589
#: 854306cc37284f3cb5aac42373517637 d55ec9f0cce64415b945895261bb8b1b
msgid "Network Packet Capture"
msgstr "网络抓包"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:7
#: 2b981240d2374194862fbe080116ca42 33506ab3a1a243b797700179cfe592c1
#: 8b6e592ccf2b4d9b90d52f811c0ab87c dbdff451472c4be1ad63e39fc3d6deb4
msgid ""
"ArduPilot can capture on-target network traffic for troubleshooting Ethernet"
" and PPP links. Captures are written in standard ``pcap`` format and can be "
"opened in tools such as Wireshark or tcpdump."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 可以在目标上捕获网络流量，用于排查以太网和 PPP 链路问题。捕获以标准 ``pcap`` 格式写入，可用 Wireshark 或 "
"tcpdump 等工具打开。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:10
#: 13e35f2126ab4dbcaba97d12263e05ad 2fc1a84ff2a641ada211367ef76b8206
#: 4da9507a2102477aa400a003948b324f a0375e2b00e048afb44042ceb38840bc
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:12
#: 22d3bd06922a49b6b715238e269a64f9 54e9ec77863b446f992231e1137bd093
#: 659394f929f04c6caa5ae9b19721e317 6fba1a4ac68c4cefb0536dc1d786b4c1
msgid ""
"When enabled, packets handled by the networking stack are written to capture"
" files on the microSD card:"
msgstr "启用后，网络协议栈处理的数据包会写入 microSD 卡上的捕获文件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:14
#: 105ce6905a074ee1baa8f578b5bd2666 271dcebe457c49c88f9d270ee027a33a
#: 4f54d6850108470385a7ce2704196d8b 8a4b9c497f6f4298a1689ba32ee534fd
msgid "**Ethernet:** ``eth0.cap``"
msgstr "**以太网：** ``eth0.cap``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:15
#: 21f4f3e36dc24bafaae8bbab573e58e1 70c1dc72d97f403a837d4b274a800b11
#: e20ecf08df31482ab0a4e9736d2f5b9c fd00a89b6c3944b094b4fef2fdc4696e
msgid "**PPP:** ``pppN.cap`` (e.g. ``ppp0.cap`` for the first PPP interface)"
msgstr "**PPP：** ``pppN.cap`` （例如第一个 PPP 接口为 ``ppp0.cap`` ）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:17
#: 30cb16c27b6c483fbd5c66808e2a17a5 53fb98182f764557ad04c464a30a23cd
#: 55128e94e71a4b5d93e8a9f89655c616 a72b1fb313aa48e28567bac3b1e27a60
msgid ""
"Capture can be enabled or disabled at runtime by toggling bit 7 in the "
":ref:`NET_OPTIONS <NET_OPTIONS>` parameter — no reboot required."
msgstr "可在运行时通过切换 :ref:`NET_OPTIONS <NET_OPTIONS>` 参数的位 7 来启用或禁用捕获——无需重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:20
#: 2dfa6d2eb12f42fdaf004db817f40513 b1de956eb0f0416ba3e593ed64bb8a5c
#: c05644bbc1d545689f29cef9ba389e59 d647e210c32f499e8664be5c3f37f0ff
msgid "Build Requirement"
msgstr "构建要求"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:22
#: 1afdbec0d6874382a9fc1feb5d3d41cf 56e918c08732492c85aecded94abd79b
#: 627042506e1649e694c2a29b50519044 d39fefd6b5e74862b97b1619e1b7f6d2
msgid ""
"This feature must be included in your firmware build even if it already has "
"the networking features since, by default, it is only included for SITL:"
msgstr "即使固件已包含网络功能，也必须在固件构建中加入此功能，因为默认情况下它仅包含在 SITL 中："

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:24
#: 048ed63e0f66425aafec66ec1d2dd186 63c1ac71d4da4887982a249491c39554
#: 86c962ea0f1b49eab2fbcb64c9c0e23b 91f8d1ffe6ec42cbaf140b13fbcc6aa8
msgid ""
"Use the `ArduPilot Custom Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__."
msgstr "使用 `ArduPilot Custom Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:25
#: 1305125eb9524b528821b38422f96afc 389be835fada46b6bdcef5c6c34803ca
#: b5e8549e5b1745e798dc49ee4ec517d5 c1ffd176bd10460fa09ba9906eecb08a
msgid "Under **Networking**, enable **NetworkCapture**."
msgstr "在 **Networking** 下启用 **NetworkCapture**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:26
#: 4e793afa59904d3383546e7ab4815e71 b13ab32af85442698f2615406e5f5248
#: e7d087437b354b8cb22495be460a6ad7 fff6322047084db2b646f59c459b7612
msgid "Download and flash the resulting firmware to your flight controller."
msgstr "下载生成的固件并烧录到你的飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:29
#: 8831549e7aa5426581bb79719ff053cc 9941659ab81344b59652162c84cd062d
#: acc4bf0d6284439aa49da7c846468ece cd26c656b74a43d49a9437470a91ebab
msgid "Enabling Capture"
msgstr "启用捕获"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:31
#: 128058d184534432aa1a00b5075dbcc3 d46bda2ab7d44eeabdd26384a7d60355
#: e5fcdfb61dd14b6ab8c5b93d9de059af e872d3009fe54fd9bb1d0804be43b31b
msgid "Confirm your firmware was built with **NetworkCapture** enabled."
msgstr "确认固件构建时启用了 **NetworkCapture**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:32
#: 1de713e3ce9a44f3a0320eff5a84df2b 544a99ad391d42da919dd080f796a9c2
#: a636245b62c7479fba8dd0bb34f8c558 ed493d295d0648b8831f873de7f63f0c
msgid "Set bit **7** of the :ref:`NET_OPTIONS <NET_OPTIONS>` bitmask."
msgstr "置位 :ref:`NET_OPTIONS <NET_OPTIONS>` 位掩码的位 **7**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:33
#: 0c8548cd390d4255944ac2bbe6c9aaf0 173c40dabfcd44c6b59813ecd6ed1302
#: 38dcddc300ce4fb6ac4aa44f26805a1e 4c993869218a4bd2b382012b8efb6a95
msgid "Capture starts immediately; **no reboot is required**."
msgstr "捕获立即开始；**无需重启**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:34
#: 356dbee3f7f24fe2921f95e4cd71db2c 805ee62072b04d55af91155cd26578d4
#: bb6f98df356749cab8d542bd89c0e1b4 e33d881c51d54b5b9f37b4793d2b4d88
msgid "To stop capture, **unset** bit 7."
msgstr "要停止捕获，**清除** 位 7。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:37
#: 0588520b00b145b19dbd498e4d82d6b5 65984db255c744c797ef1c39e4d3c56c
#: 8b48e084c3e44a55876ae6f84c6e843e d7cbc8ba93ed498eba3e6fed2b955f11
msgid "Files & Formats"
msgstr "文件与格式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:39
#: 017cc9d827ac4ac89a9da246acbc5f6f 09abbd50179646249f4a0ec4276e356d
#: 2afbb1ce07394b3f98543cc921691d48 8afcd875563d4d9a82381aacda93d577
msgid ""
"**Location:** Root of the flight controller’s microSD card (e.g. "
"``eth0.cap``, ``ppp0.cap``)."
msgstr "**位置：** 飞控 microSD 卡的根目录（例如 ``eth0.cap``、``ppp0.cap``）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:40
#: 57c336b5791d48b5bd92a3778ac52828 9ffa3c6acf59400284ebdfb0b05e463f
#: d043176d1da94628a502cb3baf00ccc4 e3d89dd2902544d2a02d35449b7cb0ec
msgid "**Format:** ``pcap`` (compatible with Wireshark/tcpdump)."
msgstr "**格式：** ``pcap`` （兼容 Wireshark/tcpdump）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:43
#: 06d5a1bc8adc4467871b2cd56fca6554 3ce923c64a244838b27d80ca121ff9d0
#: 8019f0e724dc4259bb0be12420e37c28 9badf35c74d84583b065c6d5f71294f7
msgid "Notes & Caveats"
msgstr "注意事项与限制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:45
#: 52163d6f6bfb4924b8ac3388b6e21ca6 a1b49fbb856644dc84332932ecb47725
#: c378910a6cdd4c8faa2df0c77c2919e6 df810b589e06435badfb1462a70eb336
msgid "Capturing can increase CPU and I/O load; enable only when debugging."
msgstr "抓包会增加 CPU 和 I/O 负载；仅在调试时启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:46
#: 4fbae8f978e24f17886298f6f66d737f 7cbcb9c17da44bfa9032176b64b893d4
#: c63d9de116ec496586e8635790d36fea e677fd3ba915442eae1a263b1ed32c25
msgid ""
"Ensure the microSD card has sufficient free space and is functioning "
"reliably."
msgstr "确保 microSD 卡有足够的可用空间且工作可靠。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-network-capture.rst:47
#: 1b7088288442433a8177cac388e5dcd5 33f8dc3fc3b440e8a902ec29aa6a45a5
#: 989afbe9f5d6453ca356e73f8336ce02 dbfe9b2f43f54389aabaf135c3e489b4
msgid "PPP captures are per-interface (``ppp0.cap``, ``ppp1.cap``, …)."
msgstr "PPP 抓包按接口分别保存（``ppp0.cap``、``ppp1.cap`` 等）。"
